                "word": "bipolar",
                "pos": "adj",
                "lang_code": "en",
                "forms": [
                    {
                        "form_id": "a4ec87ad-3669-4186-b9a6-aa65f7063726",
                        "entry_id": "7b212746-4c66-3b26-89a0-a158a138ac4e",
                        "tags": [
                            "comparative"
                        ],
                        "form": "more bipolar"
                    },
                    {
                        "form_id": "a90b857a-e192-4476-8fbb-6fc4f2c79045",
                        "entry_id": "7b212746-4c66-3b26-89a0-a158a138ac4e",
                        "tags": [
                            "superlative"
                        ],
                        "form": "most bipolar"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "c51126e8-570f-34f7-836b-377209ce6be7",
                        "entry_id": "7b212746-4c66-3b26-89a0-a158a138ac4e",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Involving or having both extremes or poles at the same time."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "aa628ed3-10d1-485b-965c-a6542e51e0d1",
                                "sense_id": "c51126e8-570f-34f7-836b-377209ce6be7",
                                "text": "(4) the unipolar-bipolar distinction is important in regard to these personality variables; the trait of extraversion (associated as it is with positive affectivity) may mean that individual variation here leads to a more bipolar pattern; ..."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "4510db79-9e65-42e3-924a-53cc3266831b",
                                "sense_id": "c51126e8-570f-34f7-836b-377209ce6be7",
                                "text": "Pakistan greatly resents this, but its efforts to adjust the complex have involved trying to make it more bipolar (via nuclear weapons), and not to move to another security order."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "d02c0ad0-192f-48bb-a312-7139f883b460",
                                "sense_id": "c51126e8-570f-34f7-836b-377209ce6be7",
                                "text": "And today, the world has become more and more bipolar."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "8abeeb95-878f-322b-aa8a-ea5c62f8c39a",
                        "entry_id": "7b212746-4c66-3b26-89a0-a158a138ac4e",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Relating to both polar regions."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": []
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "e3ccdbd1-b569-37fe-b048-75f5fb581b9a",
                        "entry_id": "7b212746-4c66-3b26-89a0-a158a138ac4e",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Relating to a bipole."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": []
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "a14f0499-b957-38d4-a1bf-101f73609553",
                        "entry_id": "7b212746-4c66-3b26-89a0-a158a138ac4e",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Relating to or having bipolar disorder."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "c114c448-a564-4abe-9527-89823c5b9faf",
                                "sense_id": "a14f0499-b957-38d4-a1bf-101f73609553",
                                "text": "And in both visual artists and creative writers, there is a considerably higher risk of affective disorder, more unipolar (depression only) in artists, and more bipolar (mania and depression) in writers, and leading to higher rates of alcoholism and suicide, particularly in writers (Andreasen 1987; DeLong & Aldershof, 1988; Jamison, 1986, 1995)."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "271d21ef-d76a-48ff-87ca-da8ee2ff32ef",
                                "sense_id": "a14f0499-b957-38d4-a1bf-101f73609553",
                                "text": "Since many childhood depressions become more bipolar in adult life, and because Jay's father was bipolar, I added Depakote to \"protect\" him against this bipolar possibility."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "c782bb77-bba2-4ac2-8eea-882b8b2fa1b7",
                                "sense_id": "a14f0499-b957-38d4-a1bf-101f73609553",
                                "text": "If a bipolar person you work with is receiving successful treatment, you might not even know that she is bipolar."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "04fb5dd3-290d-37de-b7b4-b4c13ada7b78",
                        "entry_id": "7b212746-4c66-3b26-89a0-a158a138ac4e",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Of or relating to an international system in which two states wield most of the cultural, economic, and political influence."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": []
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "1341f5eb-cc3d-40cb-a99e-f36651273357",
                        "source_entry_id": "7b212746-4c66-3b26-89a0-a158a138ac4e",
                        "source_sense_description": "involving both poles",
                        "target_lang_word": "bipolaire",
                        "target_lang_code": "fr",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "bipolaire",
                                "target_lang_code": "fr",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "684b746e-1e00-36bd-9014-75d4afd29bdf",
                                        "entry_id": "01a60168-f8b5-37f6-8044-7f4dee56d6ec",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Qui a deux pôles."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "7e6e6f96-a926-3eed-9ce5-77afd707db96",
                                        "entry_id": "01a60168-f8b5-37f6-8044-7f4dee56d6ec",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Qualifie l’oscillation entre un état maniaque et un état déprimé caractéristique de la psychose maniacodépressive et opposé aux troubles unipolaires (dépressions réactionnelles, mélancolie…)"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "409f3b66-6b36-48b2-b1e8-450590d97acc",
                                                "sense_id": "7e6e6f96-a926-3eed-9ce5-77afd707db96",
                                                "text": "Lucile était bipolaire et il semblerait que l’inceste figure parmi les facteurs déclenchants de la maladie."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "eb569522-2935-483b-bfff-40be295b3df4",
                                                "sense_id": "7e6e6f96-a926-3eed-9ce5-77afd707db96",
                                                "text": "Ceux qui comprennent le mieux la maladie bipolaire ne sont pas les psychiatres, mais les patients qui souffrent de cette condition, ce que souligne d'ailleurs l'essor des patients partenaires."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "ae371360-cd6d-4fb0-9e13-4f7f021692a0",
                                                "sense_id": "7e6e6f96-a926-3eed-9ce5-77afd707db96",
                                                "text": "Le professeur Raoul Belzeaux, auparavant psychiatre aux hôpitaux universitaires de Marseille, ainsi que des chercheurs et médecins de la fondation FondaMental, ont constaté, à travers un test, que des biomarqueurs sanguins permettant d’affiner le diagnostic du trouble bipolaire."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "b699f644-b851-3ac2-a0f7-25691bb23b0b",
                                        "entry_id": "01a60168-f8b5-37f6-8044-7f4dee56d6ec",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Qui a deux superpuissances. En particulier, dominé par les États-Unis et l’URSS entre 1945 et 1991."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "7289651b-7e47-4c49-9ec6-68a8c30d42ac",
                                                "sense_id": "b699f644-b851-3ac2-a0f7-25691bb23b0b",
                                                "text": "Elle est exceptionnelle en tant que tragédie, avec ses morts et la sidération du monde. Mais elle n’est pas historique à l’instar, par exemple, de l’attentat de Sarajevo, de Pearl Harbour, des conférences de Yalta et de Potsdam, ou bien encore de la fin de l’URSS, en décembre 1991, qui a marqué la fin du monde bipolaire."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "380b9b78-aff8-401c-bb78-4047d7984bd3",
                        "source_entry_id": "7b212746-4c66-3b26-89a0-a158a138ac4e",
                        "source_sense_description": "involving both poles",
                        "target_lang_word": "bipolar",
                        "target_lang_code": "de",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "bipolar",
                                "target_lang_code": "de",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "d5ddfe61-247a-3d11-811d-1890a99e34bf",
                                        "entry_id": "7c980b6c-a04b-3486-b43f-133db8ec85a8",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "zwei Pole habend; die Eigenschaften zweier sich gegenüberliegender Pole habend"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "oder auch"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "a4ff2f66-bf8b-458f-a83a-c7e230ec8f6f",
                                                "sense_id": "d5ddfe61-247a-3d11-811d-1890a99e34bf",
                                                "text": "„Beide Elektroden werden meist in einem chirurgischen Instrument vereinigt, d. h. sie sind als bipolares Schneide- oder Koagulationswerkzeug, wie z. B. eine Pinzette mit gegeneinander isolierten Schenkeln, ausgeführt.“"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "df78d2b1-6492-4b08-b7e8-3e6fdc86a17c",
                                                "sense_id": "d5ddfe61-247a-3d11-811d-1890a99e34bf",
                                                "text": "„Kleine Parteien blieben in dieser Phase marginalisiert, die Zahl der relevanten Parteien nahm nach 1958 ab. Es bildete sich eine eindeutig bipolare Struktur ohne große Anti-System-Parteien heraus.“"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "093df1ed-8d4e-4c4a-8d01-5ee10fbdb2eb",
                                                "sense_id": "d5ddfe61-247a-3d11-811d-1890a99e34bf",
                                                "text": "„Was bedeutet »bipolares Spektrum«? Die bipolare Erkrankung kann, wie andere Krankheiten auch, verschieden schwer ausgeprägt sein.“"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "13b55aeb-fdc8-4ac9-b927-2b6d0e60685a",
                                                "sense_id": "d5ddfe61-247a-3d11-811d-1890a99e34bf",
                                                "text": "„Mit dem Untergang des nationalsozialistischen Deutschlands entstand 1945 eine neue, bipolare Ordnung in Europa und darüber hinaus, die gut 40 Jahre bestehen sollte.“"
                                            }
                                        ],
                                        "sense_index_json": "\"1\""
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
